spec ro02-read-view-before-two-writers-lpg: 3 sessions, 90 permutations
# RO02 through the lpg API: s1 and s2 open write transactions, then s3 pins
# Graph.BeginRead; s1 sets x.v = 1 and s2 sets y.v = 2, each ending its transaction;
# s3 reads both. s3 sees neither.

starting permutation: s1w s1c s2w s2c s3r s3c
step s1w: lpg: SetNodeProperty(x, v, 1)
step s1c: lpg: Session.EndVersionedTx
step s2w: lpg: SetNodeProperty(y, v, 2)
step s2c: lpg: Session.EndVersionedTx
step s3r: lpg: read x.v, y.v
x.v|y.v
---+---
0  |0  
(1 row)
step s3c: lpg: Graph.EndRead
final final: MATCH (n:Item) RETURN n.name AS name, n.v AS v ORDER BY name
name|v
----+-
"x" |1
"y" |2
(2 rows)

